WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.680
Welcome, I am Melissa Dawn Simkins and I am honored to be your coach through this flagship

00:12.680 --> 00:16.140
experience called the M.V.P. Accelerator.

00:16.140 --> 00:21.780
This locker room isn't just where athletes prepare, it's where leaders are conditioned.

00:21.780 --> 00:28.140
The M.V.P. Accelerator is built for moments like this, when the pressure is on and purpose

00:28.140 --> 00:30.980
must speak louder than fear.

00:30.980 --> 00:35.100
Congratulations on making the commitment to invest in yourself.

00:35.100 --> 00:38.740
You've just stepped into the Athleadership arena.

00:38.740 --> 00:41.620
This isn't just another leadership course.

00:41.620 --> 00:46.980
This is a conditioning experience to lead through real world change.

00:46.980 --> 00:52.300
We're not here to simply train you on leadership skills that you already know.

00:52.300 --> 00:59.340
We are here to fundamentally condition your capacity to lead and perform under pressure

00:59.340 --> 01:03.380
through change and with purpose and so much passion.

01:03.380 --> 01:08.860
Over this journey, you will embark on your own championship season.

01:08.860 --> 01:19.340
We'll challenge you to go beyond going through it, to actively grow through it.

01:19.340 --> 01:23.540
We'll do this by conditioning what we call the Core 4.

01:23.540 --> 01:26.180
These are the essential performance pillars.

01:26.180 --> 01:29.220
We strengthen and measure these leadership muscles.

01:29.220 --> 01:33.300
Agility to adapt in real time with confidence.

01:33.300 --> 01:38.340
Resilience to champion under pressure and rebound stronger.

01:38.340 --> 01:42.980
Alignment to your purpose and to execute with clarity.

01:42.980 --> 01:48.860
And wellbeing to protect your energy and sustain peak performance.

01:48.860 --> 01:50.500
This is A.R.A.W.

01:50.500 --> 01:55.140
It's a framework and it's the foundation of everything we do here.

01:55.140 --> 01:58.260
Today, this is your first lesson.

01:58.260 --> 01:59.500
We suit up.

01:59.500 --> 02:02.100
We enter the Athleadership arena.

02:02.100 --> 02:07.860
We'll lay out the game plan for your season, introduce you to your core conditioning tools,

02:07.860 --> 02:14.220
and most importantly, we'll set the intention that will fuel your entire journey.

02:14.220 --> 02:15.140
Ready to get started?
